     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past + que + imperfect subjunctive",
     "texto": [
      "When the main verb is in the past, the subjunctive is also in the imperfect: **Queria que viesses** (I wanted you to come). **Pedi-lhe que viesse** (I asked him / her to come)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
